Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's an awesome\Ntreasure hidden at the end of the scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, have the\Ncourage to sail and believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.45,0:00:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.75,0:00:50.92,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3.6}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.75,0:00:50.92,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(583.02,619.65)}Feeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sailed toward different dreams,\Nthings have changed now!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.30,0:00:56.22,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3.6}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.30,0:00:56.22,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:01:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For together we found, we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.31,0:01:01.56,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3.6}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.31,0:01:01.56,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(583.02,619.65)}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NPhosCity\NScolines\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.56,0:01:08.32,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3.6}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.56,0:01:08.32,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the conscious points our destiny!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.32,0:01:12.32,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3.6}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.32,0:01:12.32,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back.\NTake the hell with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't stop all\Nour troubles, forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.77,0:01:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.33,0:01:27.96,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3.6}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.33,0:01:27.96,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.81,0:01:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regrets.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.96,0:01:32.01,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3.6\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.96,0:01:32.01,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(67.02,153.65)}AphantasticRabbit\NGordingus\NLorphex\NWestfal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried only helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.09,0:01:37.55,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3.6\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.09,0:01:37.55,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Chloelyy\NFunimation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Following Shura's vicious\Ndefeat at the hands of Wiper,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.53,0:01:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only 80 now remained in the survival game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the upper yard, perhaps\Nthey lacked divine protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.71,0:02:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the four members of Luffy's exploration
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,team know precisely the\Nlocation of the gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.75,0:02:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this island has kept secret for 400 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they set their sights on\Nit and head south from the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sacrificial altar. South.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.15,0:02:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Directly south, or down opposite\Nof north, or, uh, whatever.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.48,0:02:34.78,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur0.6\fad(606,0)\fsp-1\bord1.8\fscx95\fscy95\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(564,606,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,717)}Pirate Luffy vs. Berserker Wyper
Dialogue: 2,0:02:28.48,0:02:34.78,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur0.6\fad(606,0)\fsp-1\fscx95\fscy95\c&HF9F9FB&\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(720,717)}Pirate Luffy vs. Berserker Wyper
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the island is\Nhaving its fair share of drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet these homes were\Nbuilt so far out from the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.31,0:02:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,city in the hopes of greater\Nlongevity with crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.95,0:02:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it looks like all All this brush\Nswallowed up the mortar and brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.05,0:02:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope the city's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.35,0:02:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be aware that this\Nis a path to God's shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.87,0:03:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proceeding any further would be insolent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you get down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even have a clue as to the\Narcheological significance of these ruins?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you talk back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.95,0:03:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have some kind of business with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.91,0:03:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, simple business, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been charged by God\Nto eliminate any Shandians
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or Blue Sea people I\Nfind with my axe dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.13,0:03:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C 'est fleur.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with a twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a lack of respect
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.69,0:04:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shandians!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would've been better off\Nbeing alive at the altar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself Divine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are gonna be the end of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far, they've managed to kill a\Nlot more of us than we have of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sal should be to the right, so if I\Nkeep to the right, I should find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one of those blue sea\Npeople Wiper was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.93,0:05:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta go take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he looks pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fellas have some serious\Nanger management issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up. I lose. You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.85,0:05:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just, please, don't kill me. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, nutcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not a priest, then\Ngo find another goat to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:05:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all right what's the\Ndeal with these glowing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pistols no where'd it go\Ncouldn't have gotten far
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.65,0:06:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put up a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost sorry I underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I should apologize to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took you for a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never moved his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.71,0:07:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hagia said there were different\Ntypes of dials up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.11,0:07:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this guy has one\Nor two stuck to his shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.45,0:07:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because when he moves gusts of wind shoot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.95,0:07:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from his feet what else\Ncould it be and those
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.69,0:07:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pistols of his flash as bright as the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blinding me every time\Nhe fires where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.57,0:07:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using all three?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.07,0:08:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a hot shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, this blue sea idiot has\Nno clue about using dials.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guess what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's called a milky dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, aerial combat isn't just\Nleaping around out of desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks big!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.57,0:09:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ton of wood in these things\Nwould make for a killer barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was stupid. What's wrong with\Nme? This guy's already faster than...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and I hang myself out like an\Neasy target. Oh, and I got a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in my leg genius gotta be something\Ni could do about the flashing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pistols hold on those guns of yours\Nare some pretty nice accessories
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but too bad for you i\Nfound my lucky goggles
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means your little\Nblinding trick won't work
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:10:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On me anymore, you might\Nas well give up those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just look like regular\Ngoggles not a big fan of my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.27,0:10:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flash guns are you being\Na swordsman you need
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,close quarters to fight\Nwhich i won't give you i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.27,0:10:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't understand your\Nreasons for being here and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't care but i will\Nsay that your mere presence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defines you as an enemy\Nof the Shandians now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm telling you surrender\Nor die which might
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happen sooner if we keep\Nstanding here that leg
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of yours isn't getting any\Nbetter doesn't hurt too
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bad barely made a dent\Ngetting shot while i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.69,0:10:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made smug comments about\Nsome big dead eel proves
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm lacking in concentration\Nall right guess i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,found the perfect situation\Nto test that technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.97,0:11:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you can run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.03,0:11:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sight, sound, smell,\Ntaste, touch, and thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These six roots ground us all\Nby way of good, evil, and peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course, each of these\Ncan either be pure or impure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the 36 earthly desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, I have the barrel of a\Ncannon aimed directly at your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.45,0:11:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then all you have are a couple of pistols.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In both distance and power,\Nmy weapon's superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done very well, but\Nyou're still gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.93,0:11:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:11:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I see are three swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen a flying blade attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Single-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,36-caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing personal being\Nnatural enemies and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.07,0:12:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're in the dirt because\NI hate being told what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.15,0:12:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lost all sense of direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trees are too tall for\Nme to see the sun. Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Saru, I'll rub it. Please find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be left\Non this stinking island
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is to die and turn into\Nfood for gigantic bugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I do die, will there\Neven be a doctor waiting for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're dead, you're dead,\Nand no doctor can save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for this awful\Nplace thinking about deaths
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.53,0:13:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and doctors and wondering why\Ncouldn't I be something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.29,0:13:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dennis would be nice and hold people's\Nteeth and make them feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.37,0:14:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No giant sky sharks and winged\Npeople trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They still got my stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.39,0:14:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, maybe I've already\Ndied and gone to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These look like ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.63,0:14:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to meet at ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're already here waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I was so fast I beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so impressed with my\Nstreet navigational skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They led me to just the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.97,0:14:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.91,0:14:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.01,0:14:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the first one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A raccoon dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this all day if\Nyou want, but you can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rifles and cannons won't\Nleave a scratch on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rubber body and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.07,0:14:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for a change of tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This weapon is called the burn bazooka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By igniting the gas released\Nfrom the breath dial,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a deadly blue flame is created which will\Nincinerate anything in its path instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can\Nbounce that back at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.75,0:15:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It burned right through that giant tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Romp! Romp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.65,0:16:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Romp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.85,0:16:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you like bazookas, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a load of things!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:16:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.11,0:17:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.15,0:17:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Sanji. Get up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad. This is really bad. Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even hear his heart beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.59,0:18:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a foolishly angry man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'd come here today and brought\Nwith me pain and destruction,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would have been the\Nfirst thing you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why are you here, Aokiji?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.91,0:18:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expected a warmer hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.99,0:18:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been six years now,\Nmy former god. Gonefall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

